  "prompt": "Which months had more than 41,000 order lines? Use the sales table, which has one row per order line, and its order_month column, the first day of the month the order was placed in. Return two columns, in this order: order_month and n_lines, the number of order lines. Count every order line, including lines with missing units or a missing net_revenue_eur. Return one row per month, and only the months with more than 41,000 lines. Any row order is fine.",
